{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Notice 是一款以即時計時協助你覺察螢幕使用情況的工具，適合經常在單一 App 中忘記時間、又不想被強制封鎖的用家。它會在已連接的 App 內顯示實時計時，讓你自行判斷何時停下；原價 US $9.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-15.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>即時計時與彈性提醒</h2>\n<p>它透過「捷徑」自動化連接指定 App，開啟即開始計時、離開便暫停；實時計時會顯示於動態島或鎖定畫面。可選溫和、平衡或嚴格模式，調整提醒頻率與上限，達到上限時計時器會轉紅，亦可開啟突破靜音及專注模式的硬性上限鬧鐘；計時可共用或按 App 分開，查看今日總使用時間、次數與最長時段。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-27-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-28-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-29-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-30-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-31-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-32-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Notice – Mindful Screen Time</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/notice-mindful-screen-time/id6794823541\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.101590+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T09:15:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:38:32.415178+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:09.286937+00:00","content_hash":"b8698232278fcc6704f4372522f85fd6997e7f2940b28dcf2955fb6dc77795a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}